    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "d3b898cb365bd7db7629449d8f07bb3b2fbab8b9072d1c1726a8d839c580a98d",
      "target": "# Self-Refine 与 CRITIC：输出迭代改进\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "06e4bf1fb5ad051eac44a200274e0bb705c955b7733f3b5d7a9c4d62fc4b8f2d",
      "target": "> Self-Refine（Madaan 等，2023）让一个大语言模型（LLM）在循环中承担三种角色：生成（generate）、反馈（feedback）、改进（refine）。在 7 项任务上的平均绝对提升为 +20。CRITIC（Gou 等，2023）通过外部工具进行核验，增强反馈步骤的可靠性。到了 2026 年，各个框架都以“评估器—优化器（evaluator-optimizer）”（Anthropic）或安全护栏（guardrail）循环（OpenAI Agents SDK，SDK 即软件开发工具包）的形式提供这一模式。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "79e7d8560a23921b9385373ca67b85023f7cbca0af54596c586bc104a0e58f64",
      "target": "**Type:** Build\n**Languages:** Python (stdlib)\n**Prerequisites:** 阶段 14 · 01（智能体循环）、阶段 14 · 03（Reflexion）\n**Time:** ~60 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0006",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "584e52d24f2b17886a76212978741fa03ba6bc6aa292a0331b41402490b42267",
      "target": "## 学习目标\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0009",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "37604b34da37a41429cd9b587c4870f0e505f6fb7a31c8a658d45bb47c3ed61f",
      "target": "- 列出 Self-Refine 的三种提示词（prompt）：生成、反馈、改进，并解释为什么历史信息对改进提示词很重要。\n- 解释 CRITIC 的关键洞见：没有外部信息作为依据时，LLM 的自我核验（self-verification）并不可靠。\n- 仅用标准库实现一个带历史记录、可选用外部核验器（external verifier）的 Self-Refine 循环。\n- 将这一模式对应到 Anthropic 的“评估器—优化器”工作流和 OpenAI Agents SDK 的输出安全护栏（output guardrails）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "f88026ff32dd8f43def76262b9b1e99e1082ea528c571c9922238a9fa88f4fe5",
      "target": "## 要解决的问题\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "ae13fa4ff7b7b2e150010bf125d3eb3990c4e0b8d475349d694634d9df7ea28a",
      "target": "智能体（agent）生成了一个差一点就正确的答案。可能某行代码有语法错误，可能摘要太长，也可能计划遗漏了某种边界情况。你希望智能体对自己的输出作出评议（critique），然后加以修正。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "34addcf07bf86f9bb1c186f2ab48487c6fe3b227a6d08c22d3b49c99a1e74a4e",
      "target": "Self-Refine 表明，用单一模型就能做到这一点，无需训练数据，也无需强化学习（RL）。但有一个问题：对于确凿的事实，LLM 不擅长自我核验。CRITIC 给出的解决办法是：通过外部工具（搜索、代码解释器、计算器、测试运行器）完成核验步骤。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "8d8f66a734e20ffb8ef24d6037536e0b0aee67b4a6de599661727abc1786125e",
      "target": "这两篇论文共同定义了 2026 年迭代改进的默认做法：生成、核验（尽可能借助外部工具）、改进，在核验器判定通过时停止。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "c7b44801605d0b8c776d3915355cff883fdbf9e3ecb29219ac88ef4edd08ab1b",
      "target": "## 核心概念\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
