    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "9a6184698169f8434fe2d14671840cc8c8a6574f06e7c1cdd11de587a2628401",
      "target": "### Self-Refine（Madaan 等，NeurIPS 2023）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "a3ca273e53e7d7e4e6a9d287acea7c41b84fb0f3501b4ad9dc4cd44e9ad05305",
      "target": "一个 LLM，三种角色：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0025",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "c4e44dd6bf9e025e9b04f9374cbad7eee4e0493d0ec65ead6c8765727cc09b01",
      "target": "```text\ngenerate(task)            -> output_0\nfeedback(task, output_0)  -> critique_0\nrefine(task, output_0, critique_0, history) -> output_1\nfeedback(task, output_1)  -> critique_1\nrefine(task, output_1, critique_1, history) -> output_2\n...\nstop when feedback says \"no issues\" or budget exhausted.\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "11b94f1763d540690121cb117b4ba607c42c3371de78feb25a30cf41e8815084",
      "target": "关键细节：`refine` 会看到完整历史，即所有先前的输出和评议，从而避免重复犯错。论文对此做了消融实验：移除历史后，质量会大幅下降。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "77992e34915a1962798860802596a5b211c7f1c28f507751ebd4841fc55f45fd",
      "target": "主要结果：在 7 项任务（数学、代码、首字母缩略词、对话）上的平均绝对提升为 +20，所用模型包括 GPT-4。无需训练，无需外部工具，只用单一模型。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Self-Refine (Madaan et al., NeurIPS 2023)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "943e4b5d3f187444f06078e81f7db26dc746b51e55e87689ae7dcd8bb8c53502",
      "target": "### CRITIC（Gou 等，arXiv:2305.11738，v4，2024 年二月）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0032",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "be128a2b09e49eca97c385b70e3b01883d4fcbc638f6c1c1bd3add236941f695",
      "target": "Self-Refine 的弱点在于：反馈步骤是由 LLM 给自己评分。对于事实性陈述，这并不可靠，因为幻觉（hallucination）往往在生成它的模型看来也很有说服力。CRITIC 用 `verify(task, output, tools)` 替代 `feedback(task, output)`，其中 `tools` 包括：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0035",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "38cb0c96d639d72bcd6bc4bbf46800807c2d74b27d9a3bd462db0fc6bb164b8c",
      "target": "- 用于核查事实性陈述的搜索引擎。\n- 用于检查代码正确性的代码解释器。\n- 用于算术运算的计算器。\n- 领域专用核验器（单元测试、类型检查器、静态检查工具）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "b541ba2bf797247e9925e8711c7b57f91be9ba40d8f49c9ccd85b3d1d5d101b6",
      "target": "核验器生成以工具结果为依据的结构化评议（structured critique）。随后，改进器（refiner）以这份评议为条件进行改进。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "12231611a78b4187ebc9a0b531a7d63d2862fd85080ded608a8557173682610e",
      "target": "主要结果：CRITIC 在事实类任务上优于 Self-Refine，因为它的评议有外部依据。在没有外部核验器的任务（创意写作、格式调整）上，CRITIC 就退化为 Self-Refine。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### CRITIC (Gou et al., arXiv:2305.11738, v4 Feb 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The stop condition"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "7b5a94a77e692aebab5fddb3f5fe90d519dc4a5fe60938554106685973ca24e9",
      "target": "### 停止条件\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The stop condition"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The stop condition"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "48a76f17857e67a895bea3689dfa608c269a493f27cfb194c4bbffa43e85c774",
      "target": "常见的形式有两种：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The stop condition"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0045",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The stop condition"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "3a0b1c89f6789eb683cd2fe4eaa487a9528a5c95215631301371dccb8108e810",
      "target": "1. **核验器判定通过。** 外部测试返回成功。在有条件使用时优先采用（单元测试、类型检查器、安全护栏断言）。\n2. **不再给出反馈。** 模型说“输出没有问题”。成本更低，但不可靠；需要配合迭代次数上限。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0046",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The stop condition"
      ],
      "ordinal": 23,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The stop condition"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "6235b4950e5bfbcfb36d216faa67779b17b9f7cd678e396d4696bb310d2ab445",
      "target": "2026 年的默认做法是将二者结合：“若核验器判定通过 OR 模型说没有问题 AND iterations >= 2 OR iterations >= max_iterations，则停止。”\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0048",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### The stop condition"
      ],
      "ordinal": 24,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Evaluator-Optimizer (Anthropic, 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "c0080de846bbed34161ed253cb2f753edfdedf87fa3ac7b2d8a020f5f410b56b",
      "target": "### 评估器—优化器（Evaluator-Optimizer，Anthropic，2024）\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0050",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Evaluator-Optimizer (Anthropic, 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 25,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Evaluator-Optimizer (Anthropic, 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "171dfe0bfce3abd980a36f32d8f4f7177d3a477b02a6999c7f5805469351f80b",
      "target": "Anthropic 在 2024 年十二月的文章中将其列为五种工作流模式之一。其中有两种角色：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0052",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Evaluator-Optimizer (Anthropic, 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 26,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0053",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Evaluator-Optimizer (Anthropic, 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "144ccb8acb7b80c23e8183169cfb37367fcb8e66c889ce3b6c81f826e6567f7e",
      "target": "- 评估器（Evaluator）：给输出评分，并生成评议。\n- 优化器（Optimizer）：根据评议修改输出。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Evaluator-Optimizer (Anthropic, 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Evaluator-Optimizer (Anthropic, 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "cb58880483e9e90c3eede941033b88310cd661a685aa941ac1fcbc0f65814d6c",
      "target": "循环执行，直到评估器判定通过。这就是 Anthropic 表述下的 Self-Refine/CRITIC。Anthropic 补充的关键工程细节是：评估器与优化器的提示词应该有显著差异，避免模型只是机械地认可输出。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### Evaluator-Optimizer (Anthropic, 2024)"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### OpenAI Agents SDK output guardrails"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "20227923102cb0bffc9937f50f34163d57101abf0ec5ec32e50dbf581683cee8",
      "target": "### OpenAI Agents SDK 输出安全护栏\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0058",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### OpenAI Agents SDK output guardrails"
      ],
      "ordinal": 29,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### OpenAI Agents SDK output guardrails"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "269320c4437e13a9ee98872be626a23bead8bc57b98ff50b03fc075a8bf1e155",
      "target": "OpenAI Agents SDK 以“输出安全护栏”的形式提供这一模式。安全护栏是一种验证器，会对智能体的最终输出运行检查。如果安全护栏被触发（抛出 `OutputGuardrailTripwireTriggered`），输出就会被拒绝，智能体可以重试。安全护栏可以调用工具（CRITIC 风格），也可以是纯函数（Self-Refine 风格）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0060",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### OpenAI Agents SDK output guardrails"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 pitfalls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "eff3a9e21c6e7d9c6a58b0b1563b49ae775b1cefb17a52f98226b736f4b85ce3",
      "target": "### 2026 年的常见陷阱\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0062",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 pitfalls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 31,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0063",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 pitfalls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "eb2bbcf722dd2a186cf3b24082e441b2462e83d2bcf8b56e7c6aa5194b1937ad",
      "target": "- **机械认可循环（rubber-stamp loop）。** 同一模型使用风格相同的提示词进行生成和评议，最终总会得出“我看没问题”的结论。应使用结构上不同的提示词，或用一个更小、更便宜的模型来作评议。\n- **过度改进（over-refinement）。** 每轮改进都会增加延迟和 token（词元）用量。将预算设为 1-3 轮；超过这个范围就转交人工审查。\n- **在简单任务上使用 CRITIC。** 如果没有外部核验器，CRITIC 就退化为 Self-Refine；不要为桩核验器付出额外延迟。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0064",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 pitfalls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 32,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0065",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## The Concept",
        "### 2026 pitfalls"
      ],
      "ordinal": 33,
      "source_sha256": "f8df60d3f1296e2605d11db629989053351ec23773e5e9dd5e649cc3896afe9a",
      "target": "```figure\nself-refine\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0066",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
