    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "5098ba919d642cf905684f5640f383149fb5c1fe1ecaf0d58f7146ae08408ecd",
      "target": "`code/main.py` 在一个玩具任务上实现了 Self-Refine 和 CRITIC：根据给定主题生成简短的项目符号列表。核验器检查格式（3 个条目，每条少于 60 个字符）。CRITIC 另外加入一个外部“事实核验器”，对已知幻觉施加惩罚。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0070",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 35,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "a1df4bcb1703ab84e54dd14ea907b93bbf7932a705475f937b65fdd970881fe0",
      "target": "组件：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0072",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 36,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0073",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "f3afe548d1327da5f31d98c22da229d46273fa4c90c6112f6095b696abc185fd",
      "target": "- `generate`：脚本化生成器。\n- `feedback`：LLM 风格的自我评议。\n- `verify_external`：CRITIC 风格、以外部信息为依据的核验器。\n- `refine`：根据历史记录重写输出。\n- 停止条件：核验器判定通过，或最多迭代 4 次。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0074",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 37,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 38,
      "source_sha256": "936bc51db6511ea885c12022f0e1271632a7d165e0848edeaf255b3a5786e28d",
      "target": "运行：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0076",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
