      "source_sha256": "2b11889f93c0782398b09d152e929afa595931801ff18ec85374f752a13e31bd",
      "target": "```text\npython3 code/main.py\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0078",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 39,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Build It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 40,
      "source_sha256": "c793acc29893f8021630743e2e794e792f2ffe58b761decbd81a02897aef1923",
      "target": "比较 Self-Refine 和 CRITIC 的运行结果。CRITIC 能发现 Self-Refine 漏掉的事实错误，因为外部核验器具备自我评议器所没有的外部依据。\n"
    },
    {
