    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "5ea8444f1e52d79d0fa5a9889d9e68b6f9378788af91764ac90a2934dcc50b2b",
      "target": "## 实际使用\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0082",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 41,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Use It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 42,
      "source_sha256": "cb9258834c0592d7b74204c48b4b40bc2c32c7cf9cb4f021fdba5fc42d67ceab",
      "target": "Anthropic 的评估器—优化器就是用适合 Claude 的术语来描述这一模式。OpenAI Agents SDK 的输出安全护栏具有 CRITIC 的形式，因为安全护栏可以调用工具。LangGraph 提供的反思节点与 Self-Refine 相似。Google 的 Gemini 2.5 Computer Use 增加了逐步安全评估器，这是 CRITIC 的一种变体：每个行动都在提交前进行核验。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0084",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
