    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Ship It"
      ],
      "ordinal": 44,
      "source_sha256": "dbd0d16570b8586e1b8f8b03612c6bc516b35ab482c2cd02c2e3cb2c0c97efe0",
      "target": "`outputs/skill-refine-loop.md` 根据任务形式、核验器是否可用以及迭代预算，配置一个评估器—优化器循环。它会生成用于生成器、评估器/核验器、优化器的提示词，以及一套停止策略。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0088",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
