    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0089",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 45,
      "source_sha256": "a4807fe836e0096bcaf158b29f934e8fe31d4f4827549967dfe8f4f2fb831a64",
      "target": "## 练习\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0090",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 45,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0091",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Self-Refine and CRITIC: Iterative Output Improvement",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 46,
      "source_sha256": "4c9c081a8eae115556468d65f2999c3c5536ec436c5aaee637e2a3eaddb73ac0",
      "target": "1. 以 max_iterations=1 运行玩具示例。CRITIC 仍然有帮助吗？\n2. 将外部核验器换成一个有噪声的核验器（随机产生 30% 的误报）。循环会怎么做？这就是 2026 年大多数安全护栏技术栈的现实。\n3. 实现一个“生成器和评议器使用不同模型”的变体：大模型生成，小模型评议。它比使用同一模型更好吗？\n4. 阅读 CRITIC 第 3 节（arXiv:2305.11738 v4）。说出三类核验工具，并各举一个例子。\n5. 将 OpenAI Agents SDK 的 `output_guardrails` 对应到 CRITIC 的核验器角色。这个 SDK 哪些地方做得不对，哪些地方做对了？\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-05:b0092",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
